  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Ukrainian Refugees through Media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports Ukrainian refugees in 3 neighbouring countries of Ukraine (i.e., Republic of Moldova, Romania, and Slovakia) as well as the host governments in their refugee response through media, by harnessing the full potential of mainstream media and their online presence during the critical period. The project aims to increase refugees&apos; access to reliable information on key topics of interest and concern, and on assistance concerted by authorities and partners, enhance their self-reliance and resilience, and create favourable conditions for peaceful albeit temporary co-existence of refugees and host communities by strengthening fact-based information exchange.</narrative>
  </description>
